  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/507",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">간이온도계 만들려고 하는데,<br>얇은 빨대와 글루건을 못 찾았어요. <br><br>뭘로 대신해보지?? 또 스포이트? <br>네~ 스포이트로!^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bcf82b3cd1417dc0f174555db10c4a63df299b5b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bcf82b3cd1417dc0f174555db10c4a63df299b5b\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">깔끔하지요? </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3601307462d7cc4a0f290b731c7116b6a6e29e8f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3601307462d7cc4a0f290b731c7116b6a6e29e8f\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">요거만 있으면 됩니다. (아, 더하기 식용색소)<br>30ml 물약병, 송곳, 1ml 일회용 스포이트</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8cc361c29e90b3db3e8f535c77a5955255ac210\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8cc361c29e90b3db3e8f535c77a5955255ac210\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc7d64205122a4eb769bc0958797289126d4b712\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc7d64205122a4eb769bc0958797289126d4b712\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">물약병 주둥이(?)부분에 송곳을 넣어서 조금 넓혀주구요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5c24a93a8de3c5bfbcbfa8a8065365548229ad67\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5c24a93a8de3c5bfbcbfa8a8065365548229ad67\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1ml 스포이트를 위에서 꽂아줍니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a08f7b4d210d6740218d7723fa09283ec055f529\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a08f7b4d210d6740218d7723fa09283ec055f529\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">스포이트 2칸을 넣어주면 요만큼 아래로 튀어나옵니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f69992466622a6fb7c8c755c8d31b3d5fe98259e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f69992466622a6fb7c8c755c8d31b3d5fe98259e\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">적당하게 위를 잘라주면 됩니다. <br><br>이제 색소물 가득 채우고 스포이트 꽂은 뚜껑 닫으면 끝. </p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
